    56	/**
    57	 * The daily sweep: walks every non-cancelled subscription and applies
    58	 * whatever decideSweepAction() (pure, already unit-tested) says. Suspends
    59	 * the linked deployment, if any, once a subscription is actually cancelled
    60	 * — not when it merely goes past_due, which is just a warning state with a
